{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】屯門有兩輛巴士相撞，九人受傷。</p>\n<p>兩名巴士司機及其中一名乘客，分別由救護員陪同登上救護車。警方早上八時許接報，一輛九巴在屯門鳴琴路近山景邨對開，懷疑收掣不及撞向前面一輛切線的另一輛九巴。兩名巴士司機以及七名巴士乘客受傷，要送院治理。現場交通一度受阻。</p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T02:21:51.913060+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":132,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T02:04:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T02:17:52.909106+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T02:17:52.909106+00:00","content_hash":"c8c71cb7f5cde3c91c8727a9c480e572cf93960278a38a99987536913f73bede","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}